| `.github/workflows/canary.yml` | Runs `make canary` weekly and on demand, on full history so the update path has the previous release tag, and uploads each kept project and its log when one fails. | the schedule, or a manual run | [`canary.answer_sets`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Weekly, not on every push: one run is a project verify per set and path. Holds no logic: the canary is `scripts/canary.py`. Not the per-push gate: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` is. | [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) | keel maintainers only |
